27:12.240 --> 27:14.030
Cakaplah! Awak dah bunuh dia, kan?

27:14.030 --> 27:14.550
Cakaplah!

27:14.550 --> 27:15.260
Li.

27:15.400 --> 27:15.860
Awak...

27:46.030 --> 27:48.050
Awak tak boleh mengelak lagi sekarang,

27:48.050 --> 27:49.250
