29:21.810 --> 29:22.400
Zixiu.

29:23.720 --> 29:25.320
Jangan tunjuk sembarangan.

29:38.110 --> 29:40.270
Tao Sha dah balik!

29:40.300 --> 29:41.850
Tao Sha dah balik!

29:54.240 --> 29:55.570
Pengawal Bulu Terbang,

29:55.740 --> 29:56.870
Formasi Lapan Yang.

30:18.920 --> 30:19.750
Berhenti!

30:22.440 --> 30:23.770
Dia bukan syaitan,

30:24.110 --> 30:25.150
